{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/646832f153afce8a4ce5d084ca360a1f.avif?t=1758285687\" width=600 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trenches VR is First-Person World War I Survival Horror VR game where you have to escape the claustrophobic environment and experience the war from the eyes of a soldier caught behind enemy lines.  In this surreal nightmare, fight for your life and for your sanity as you explore the harsh war-torn environment.   Your only motive is to return to your family.  Your only help.  An old trench whistle and your instincts to survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This game may be disturbing to some audience as this game contains disturbing images, sounds, fear nature, intense jump scares and intense horror that may not be for the Faint of heart. Play this game at your own risk.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trenches VR is a psychological horror game \u2014 enemies can hear your breathing, whispers, and cries for help. Stay quiet, stay hidden\u2026 or they\u2019ll come for you.  Try to escape by collecting vital clues and find out what is going on.  Use your trench whistle to guide you and follow the sounds.  But this comes at a price since the enemy can hear your trench whistle and blowing it will give away your position.  Enemies will also be able to hear if you walk on wood as it will make creaking noise or if you break any bottles. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/ccf43d5849494c9c724e6ea148414f9d.avif?t=1758285687\" width=600 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/37b4037a03ded123ba8de422a85e6c94.poster.avif?t=1758285687\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/37b4037a03ded123ba8de422a85e6c94.webm?t=1758285687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/37b4037a03ded123ba8de422a85e6c94.mp4?t=1758285687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insanity: Just because you passed somewhere already, does not mean that there is nothing there. The environment may change with your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan Accordingly: Plan your next move as it may be your last. Peak around corners, watch your footsteps and be always on the move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/ce89505645c2d856b5c1cb7f578d6ebe.poster.avif?t=1758285687\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/ce89505645c2d856b5c1cb7f578d6ebe.webm?t=1758285687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/extras/ce89505645c2d856b5c1cb7f578d6ebe.mp4?t=1758285687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2687660?t=1758285687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758285687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758285687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758285687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id"